      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00019",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[19]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 2480,
      "endIndex": 2621,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "If you are wearing polyester in July, you are doing it wrong. Here is why natural fabrics are your best friend when the sun is beating down.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00020",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[20]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 2621,
      "endIndex": 2622,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00021",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[21]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 2622,
      "endIndex": 2659,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "1. Nature's Air Conditioning (Linen)",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00022",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[22]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 2659,
      "endIndex": 2913,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Linen fibers are completely hollow, which means they allow massive amounts of air to pass directly through the garment. Linen absorbs moisture quickly and releases it just as fast, keeping your skin noticeably cooler than the actual temperature outside.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00023",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[23]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 2913,
      "endIndex": 2914,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00024",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[24]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 2914,
      "endIndex": 2940,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "2. 100% Breathable Cotton",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00025",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[25]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 2940,
      "endIndex": 3109,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Unlike plastics and synthetics that trap heat against your body, pure cotton is highly porous. It breathes naturally and feels incredibly soft against sun-exposed skin.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00026",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[26]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 3109,
      "endIndex": 3110,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00027",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[27]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 3110,
      "endIndex": 3126,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "3. Odor Control",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00028",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[28]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 3126,
      "endIndex": 3363,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Because natural fabrics let your skin breathe and dry out quickly, sweat doesn't sit trapped in the fibers. This makes it infinitely harder for odor-causing bacteria to grow, keeping you smelling fresh even on the most humid afternoons.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00029",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[29]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
