    {
      "paragraphId": "P00053",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[53]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 5037,
      "endIndex": 5154,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Sweat, sunscreen, and saltwater can be tough on clothes. Here is how to keep your summer wardrobe looking brand new.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00054",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[54]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 5154,
      "endIndex": 5155,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00055",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[55]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 5155,
      "endIndex": 5302,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "1. Wash on Cold: Hot water will shrink your linen and cotton pieces. Always stick to cold washes to preserve the fit and the bright summer colors.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00056",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[56]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 5302,
      "endIndex": 5455,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "2. Wash After Heavy Sweating: Don't let sweat and sunscreen sit in the fabric for days. Wash your pieces promptly to avoid yellowing around the collars.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00057",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[57]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 5455,
      "endIndex": 5627,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "3. Absolutely No Dryers: The tumble dryer will bake the life out of natural fibers. Hang your clothes up outside in the shade and let the summer breeze dry them naturally.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00058",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[58]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 5627,
      "endIndex": 5781,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "4. Don't Over-Iron Linen: Embrace the wrinkles! Linen is supposed to look relaxed and slightly textured. A quick run over with a steamer is all you need.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00059",
